msgid "Move the table anywhere in the background's scenery - handy in big ones like a converted map. "
msgstr "将桌子移动到背景风景中的任何位置 - 对于像转换后的地图这样的大风景来说很方便。 "

msgid "%d%% translated"
msgstr "%d%% 已翻译"

msgid "Notification log keeps"
msgstr "通知日志保留"

msgid "How many turns of messages the overview's Notifications tab keeps."
msgstr "概述的“通知”选项卡保留多少轮消息。"

msgid "Unciv's tutorials: a message when something new comes up, and a task card with the next thing to try."
msgstr "Unciv 的教程：出现新内容时的消息，以及包含下一个要尝试的内容的任务卡。"

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重置"

msgid "Unciv's own sound effects. They are read from the Unciv folder next to this one when the game runs; put your own in ~/.unciv-vr/Sounds under the same names to replace them."
msgstr "Unciv 自己的音效。当游戏运行时，它们会从该文件夹旁边的 Unciv 文件夹中读取；将您自己的内容放在 ~/.unciv-vr/Sounds 中的同名下以替换它们。"

msgid "%d sounds found. Every unit's attack sound comes from the ruleset, like Unciv's."
msgstr "找到 %d 声音。每个单位的攻击声音都来自规则集，就像 Unciv 的一样。"

msgid "No sounds found. They live in Unciv's android/assets/sounds, next to this folder."
msgstr "没有发现任何声音。它们位于 Unciv 的 android/assets/sounds 中，就在该文件夹旁边。"

msgid "Boards with a list on them, built from what the game knows. In VR they stand around the table "
msgstr "板上有一个列表，是根据游戏已知的信息构建的。在 VR 中，他们站在桌子周围 "

msgid "(hold the trigger on the strip along the top to move one); on the desktop they sit down the left side."
msgstr "（按住顶部条带上的扳机可移动一个）；在桌面上，它们坐在左侧。"

msgid "A panel is a folder with a panel.json - see panels/README.md. Put yours in %s."
msgstr "面板是一个带有 panel.json 的文件夹 - 请参阅 panels/README.md. 将您的放入 %s 中。"

msgid "Put them back"
msgstr "把它们放回去"

msgid "(by %s)"
msgstr "（作者：%s）"

msgid "Every turn"
msgstr "每个回合"

msgid "Every %d turns"
msgstr "每转 %d"

msgid "not connected"
msgstr "未连接"

msgid "v%s (this client expects v%s)"
msgstr "v%s（此客户端需要 v%s）"

msgid "Tilesets"
msgstr "地块集"

msgid "Unciv VR is under the Mozilla Public License 2.0, like Unciv. The icons are Unciv's own, by many authors "
msgstr "与 Unciv 一样，Unciv VR 也遵循 Mozilla 公共许可证 2.0。这些图标是 Unciv 自己的，由许多作者设计 "

msgid "under CC BY / CC BY-SA / CC0 licences (see CREDITS.md and Unciv's docs/Credits.md). The tile, unit, background "
msgstr "根据 CC BY / CC BY-SA / CC0 许可证（请参阅 CREDITS.md 和 Unciv 的 docs/Credits.md）。瓷砖、单元、背景 "

msgid "and table models are Unciv VR's own."
msgstr "和桌子模型是 Unciv VR 自己的。"

msgid "%s speed"
msgstr "%s 速度"

