msgstr "还没有什么奇迹可以展示。"

msgid "Every unit you have, the ones still waiting for orders first, with what each is doing. Click one to select it."
msgstr "你拥有的每个单位，那些仍然首先等待命令的单位，每个单位都在做什么。单击其中一个将其选中。"

msgid "Every city you have, the capital first, with what each is building and how big it is. Click one to open its card."
msgstr "你拥有的每个城市，首先是首都，每个城市正在建设什么以及有多大。单击其中一张即可打开其卡片。"

msgid "Every military unit you have, with its action, moves and health. Click one to select it."
msgstr "你拥有的每一个军事单位，及其行动、行动和生命值。单击其中一个将其选中。"

msgid "Rankings of all known civilizations by total score points."
msgstr "所有已知文明的总得分排名。"

msgid "Unciv's wonders overview, by era: which are built, being built or still to build. Click a built one to look at it."
msgstr "Unciv 的奇迹概览（按时代）：已建成、正在建设或仍在建设中。单击已构建的即可查看它。"

msgid "In the Hall of the Mountain King"
msgstr "山王殿内"

msgid "The subterranean throne hall of the Troll King deep within the Dovre mountains, lit by fire braziers and glowing magma veins"
msgstr "多夫勒山脉深处巨魔王的地下王座大厅，被火盆和发光的岩浆脉照亮"

msgid "Mountains and clouds"
msgstr "山和云"

msgid "A meadow ringed by low-poly peaks, with trees and drifting clouds"
msgstr "一片草地，周围环绕着低多边形山峰，树木茂盛，云朵飘逸"

msgid "Floating in space"
msgstr "漂浮在太空中"

msgid "The table floats among the stars, by a ringed planet"
msgstr "桌子漂浮在恒星之间，靠近一颗有环的行星"

msgid "Studio"
msgstr "工作室"

msgid "A plain, dark room"
msgstr "一间朴素、黑暗的房间"

msgid "Webb Deep Field"
msgstr "韦伯深场"

msgid "The table floats in deep space, surrounded by the James Webb Space Telescope's First Deep Field"
msgstr "桌子漂浮在深空，周围环绕着詹姆斯·韦伯太空望远镜的第一个深场"

msgid "Ornate oak"
msgstr "华丽的橡木"

msgid "Oak with walnut and holly stringing, a carved rope edge, and a pedestal on scroll feet"
msgstr "橡木，胡桃木和冬青弦，雕刻绳边，卷脚上有底座"

msgid "Plain wood"
msgstr "原木"

msgid "A round dark wooden slab on a tapering column"
msgstr "锥形柱上的圆形深色木板"

msgid "Low poly"
msgstr "低聚"

msgid "Faceted low-poly terrain, one flat colour per face"
msgstr "多面低多边形地形，每个面一种平面颜色"

